    <li>4 inputs for sensors or an analog room control unit (SAF/A or SAR/A)</li>
    <li>2 valve outputs for activating valve drives (FCC/S 1.4.1.1: 1 valve output)</li>
    <li>1 fan output</li>
    <li>1 relay output (FCC/S 1.4.1.1: no relay output)</li>
